    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39010" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιγᾰμ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>marry besides</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πόσει
				πόσιν</span>
			<i>wed one</i> husband <i>after</i> another, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				589
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ θυγατρὶ ἐ. τὴν μητέρα</span>
			<i>marry</i> the mother <i>after</i> the daughter, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.128
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τέκνοις μητρυιάν</span>
			<i>marry and</i>
			<i>set</i> a stepmother <i>over</i> one's children, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				305
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat.Ma.</u>
				24
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐπιγαμηθεῖσα γυνή</span>
			<i>the second</i> wife, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				16.93
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Them.</u>
				32
			</span></i>.</div>
